Example: rebalance three funds midyear without adding or withdrawing money.
Salary funds two units each of ALPHA, BETA, and GAMMA at 100 USD per unit on
2023-01-01, so the selected holdings start at 600 USD. On 2023-07-01 their
prices are 120, 80, and 40 USD; the six units are worth 240 + 160 + 80 = 480.
One ALPHA unit is sold for 120 USD, and those proceeds buy one BETA for 80 USD
and one GAMMA for 40 USD. The holdings become one ALPHA, three BETA, and three
GAMMA, still worth 120 + 240 + 120 = 480 USD. The selected fund flows on that
date are -120 + 80 + 40 = 0: rebalancing is not an external contribution.
On 2023-12-31, prices are 150, 110, and 70 USD. Their individual price returns
since January are +50%, +10%, and -30%, respectively. The rebalanced holdings
end at 150 + 330 + 210 = 690 USD. Without rebalancing, the original two of
each would end at 300 + 220 + 140 = 660 USD.
Net contributions are 600 USD and profit/loss is 690 - 0 - 600 = 90 USD.
The time-weighted factors are 480 / 600 and 690 / 480, giving 15% overall.
Over the 364 days from January 1 to December 31, that is 15.04% annualized.
The 600 USD invested on January 1 grows to 690 USD on December 31: the total
money-weighted return is 15%, with a slightly higher annualized rate over
this 364-day interval.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight investment-performance --accounts 'Assets:Funds:*' --commodities ALPHA --commodities BETA --commodities GAMMA --from 2023-01-01 --to 2023-12-31 --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  default
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity ALPHA
  format 1,000 ALPHA
commodity BETA
  format 1,000 BETA
commodity GAMMA
  format 1,000 GAMMA
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Funds:Alpha
account Assets:Funds:Beta
account Assets:Funds:Gamma
account Income:Salary
account Income:Gains
P 2023-01-01 ALPHA 100 USD
P 2023-01-01 BETA 100 USD
P 2023-01-01 GAMMA 100 USD
P 2023-07-01 ALPHA 120 USD
P 2023-07-01 BETA 80 USD
P 2023-07-01 GAMMA 40 USD
P 2023-12-31 ALPHA 150 USD
P 2023-12-31 BETA 110 USD
P 2023-12-31 GAMMA 70 USD

2023-01-01 Salary
  Assets:Cash  600 USD
  Income:Salary  -600 USD

2023-01-01 Buy three funds
  Assets:Funds:Alpha  2 ALPHA {100 USD}
  Assets:Funds:Beta  2 BETA {100 USD}
  Assets:Funds:Gamma  2 GAMMA {100 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -600 USD

2023-07-01 Sell one Alpha
  Assets:Funds:Alpha  -1 ALPHA {100 USD} @ 120 USD
  Assets:Cash  120 USD
  Income:Gains  -20 USD

2023-07-01 Buy more Beta and Gamma
  Assets:Funds:Beta  1 BETA {80 USD}
  Assets:Funds:Gamma  1 GAMMA {40 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -120 USD

========== OUTPUT ==========

Investment performance from 2023-01-01 to 2023-12-31
Instruments: 3
Opening value: 0.00 USD
Net contributions: 600.00 USD
Ending value: 690.00 USD
Profit/loss: 90.00 USD
Time-weighted return (total): 15.00 %
Time-weighted return (annualized): 15.04 %
Money-weighted return (total): 15.00 %
Money-weighted return (annualized): 15.04 %

